stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending : Pod Scheduled
    Pending --> ContainerCreating : Images Pulling
    ContainerCreating --> Running : Readiness Probe Succeeded
    Running --> Terminating : SIGTERM Sent
    Running --> CrashLoopBackOff : Liveness Probe Failed
    CrashLoopBackOff --> Running : Exponential Backoff Retry
    Terminating --> Succeeded : Exit Code 0
    Terminating --> Failed : Exit Code != 0
    Succeeded --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
